; claude: compression, from scratch: Huffman codes, DEFLATE (LZ77 +
; Huffman, RFC 1951) and its zlib wrapper (RFC 1950), with their
; checksums -- what PNG's pixels are compressed with, and what JPEG's
; Huffman codes share (see notes_images.md, sections 2, 3 and 6). Pure
; OCaml, like xpm/. A private library (see graphics/core/dune),
; installed as part of elm_playground.
